# NEXUS AI Report: Consolidated FPS Game Engine Architecture

## Executive Summary
This report provides the finalized blueprint for a high-concurrency, low-latency FPS game architecture. Designed for **Vibhav**, this system integrates client-side responsiveness with strict server-side authority to ensure a fair and performant competitive environment.

